<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Sydney airport gets A$56 mln road funding.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Sydney airport gets A$56 mln road funding.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's Federal Airports Corp (FAC) said on Monday it has approved A$56 million for road development work at Sydney airport.</p>
<p>The funds will be used to build an elevated road separating the domestic arrivals and departure terminals, and for redevelopment of the roads and car parks at the international terminal, the FAC said.</p>
<p>Work at the international terminal is expected to be completed by November 1997 and at the domestic terminal by mid-1998, the FAC said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
